-# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-# The stable-fallback bundle
-#
-# A level-A producer declares a workflow schema and nothing else.  The contract
-# still needs a field model and a recipe set, so one is supplied -- and the fact
-# that it was supplied, rather than declared, is recorded on the contract.
-#
-# Both the parsed model and the *document* are carried, because a digest has to
-# be taken over the wire form: re-serialising a parsed manifest would drop the
-# unknown members the parser deliberately ignores, and the digest would then
-# describe something the producer never published.
