-# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-# The shipped stable-fallback manifest
-#
-# This is NOT an authority.  It is a version-pinned snapshot that lets the GUI
-# start without a producer, run offline, and keep working while a producer
-# contract is unavailable.  It is labelled as a fallback everywhere it surfaces,
-# and once ConfFlow publishes an editor manifest of its own this file becomes
-# dead weight rather than a second source of truth.
-#
-# Snapshot binding: confflow 2.1.6, workflow schema `confflow.workflow.v2`,
-# schema sha256 38c45669ff9f3be0d352ab8d6bb2a64be9cd67bb2327dd89cd72d804aee2e7ca
-# (observed from `confflow config contract --json`).
-#
-# The `default` values below fall into two categories and the distinction is the
-# reason this comment exists:
-#
-#   producer semantic defaults  -- values ConfFlow itself applies when a field is
-#       absent.  These are copied verbatim from `confflow/shared/defaults.py`
-#       (DEFAULT_CHARGE, DEFAULT_MULTIPLICITY, DEFAULT_CORES_PER_TASK,
-#       DEFAULT_TOTAL_MEMORY, DEFAULT_MAX_PARALLEL_JOBS, DEFAULT_SCAN_COARSE_STEP,
-#       DEFAULT_TS_BOND_DRIFT_THRESHOLD, DEFAULT_TS_RESCUE_SCAN) and from
-#       `confgen_params.py` (angle_step, bond_threshold).  V2 never writes them
-#       into a document; they exist only so `FieldState.origin == "default"` can
-#       report what the producer will do.  If ConfFlow changes one of these, this
-#       snapshot is stale and only the producer can say so.
-#
-#   presentation values -- labels, descriptions, group names, ordering, and the
-#       choice labels.  These are genuinely JobDesk's to own; they are shown to a
-#       human and no producer artefact depends on them.
-#
-# `contract_key` here is producer-document metadata.  The identity V2 actually
-# stores on a draft is derived by `VerifiedEditorContract.contract_key` from the
-# verified digests, because provenance belongs to the envelope, not the payload.
-# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
