-class LocalFileByteSource:
-    """Read bytes from a local path.
-
-    ``base`` is prepended when the requested location is relative, so a caller can
-    hand a bare filename in a known directory without knowing the directory.  An
-    absolute location ignores ``base`` -- a caller that resolved a location fully
-    should get exactly that location.
-    """
